    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893960/extras/124729230701e4f98eaff5525020c509.avif?t=1725336384\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893960/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1725336384\" /></div><br><br>\u25a0Plot<br>I woke up in a mysterious forest.<br>I had no idea who I was or why I was here.<br>Then, I met some friends and went on an adventure...<br><br>\u25a0Game contents<br>- Enemies you beat can join your party.<br>- Fight all kinds of enemies in this fantasy RPG. But watch out! If you make the wrong call, something bad might happen... <br>- Win at all costs and move on!<br>- Don't let your enemies lure you in. Use special skills to keep a cool head.<br>- The story is a pretty straightforward. <br>You will be asked to make some decisions but it won't affect the story outcome.<br>- No leveling up required to win.<br>Enjoy the story without spending hours leveling up.<br>- A simple battle system for RPG beginners!<br>- Messages can be skipped<br>- Orthodox turn-based battle RPG",
